  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CDoT Institutional Support for Development Office and Community Empowerment Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at addressing capacity issues of the diocesan Development office linked to the delivery of basic services to the community through development of a strategic plan to provide a clearer vision in service delivery and strengthen leadership, mobilization and participation in development and humanitarian activities at the grassroots level.

Activities to maintain community mobilization and participation in various development activities will be implemented along side the main objective of developing the strategic plan.</narrative>
  </description>
